msgstr ""

msgid "Be the first player to place four of your pieces in one continuous horizontal, vertical or diagonal line."
msgstr ""

msgid "Be the first player to reach the target score, which is 1000 points by default. Win tricks, fulfil the contract you won in the auction and use king-queen marriages to earn their bonuses and establish trump."
msgstr ""

#: games/audio_ball.rb:189
msgid "Before playing, you can listen to the sounds in the audio tutorial. Open Game rules with Ctrl+F1 and choose Audio tutorial. Browse with the arrow keys, then press Enter or Space to hear the selected sound. The list explains which key goes with each shot, so you can learn the sounds without having to recognise them during a rally."
msgstr ""

#: games/audio_ball.rb:206
msgid "Before serving or after a defence, you may hold the ball for as long as you like unless the opponent warns you with Ctrl+W. You then have ten seconds to hit. Preparing does not stop or restart the countdown, and repeated warnings do not give you more time. If you fail to hit before time runs out, the opponent scores a point. Only your opponent can issue a warning; observers cannot."
