msgstr ""

msgid "Challenging Wild Draw Four is off by default and available only in Classic. F challenges the last such play: if its author still had a card of the previous colour, they draw four instead. If the play was justified, the challenger draws six and loses the turn. This is not an automatic check on every wild play."
msgstr ""

