#: games/chess.rb:51
msgid "Chess is a game for two players. White moves first, then the players alternate one move at a time. Each begins with a king, queen, two rooks, two bishops, two knights and eight pawns on an 8 by 8 board. Your aim is to attack the opposing king in a way your opponent cannot escape: this is checkmate. You do not actually capture the king."
