msgid "Choose Single or Doubles immediately after Arcade when creating the table. Doubles requires four players. Before starting, the table master assigns two players to each team in the standard team selection window. Each player has their own paddle and can reposition at any time. Partners must return alternately: if A serves to C, the rally continues C, B, D, A, C. Only the designated player can return, including automatic returns and shield returns. Your teammate uses the same footstep sound as you; both opponents use the other footstep sound. Each step is positioned at the paddle of the player who moved."
