msgstr "Duplicitní odpověď, 5 bodů"

msgid "During exchange, arrows choose a card and Shift+Enter adds or removes it from the packet. Enter exchanges the packet, including the current card if it was not selected. Keep all cards ends the exchange without replacing any. Shift+C, Shift+H and Shift+M sort that hand by suit, rank and receipt order; repeating C or H with Shift reverses its order."
msgstr "Během výměny šipkami vybíráte kartu a Shift+Enter ji přidá do sady nebo ji odebere. Enter sadu vymění a zahrne i aktuální kartu, pokud nebyla vybrána. Volba Ponechat všechny karty ukončí výměnu bez nahrazení kterékoli karty. Shift+C, Shift+H a Shift+M řadí tyto karty v ruce podle barvy, hodnoty a pořadí získání; opakované stisknutí C nebo H se Shiftem obrátí pořadí."

msgid "During judging, use Tab to move between grouped answers, choose an assessment with the arrow keys, then press Finish review."
msgstr "Při hodnocení přecházejte klávesou Tab mezi seskupenými odpověďmi, šipkami zvolte hodnocení a pak stiskněte Dokončit hodnocení."

msgid "During judging, use the arrow keys to choose an assessment, Enter to confirm it, and Tab to move between grouped answers. Finish review closes judging."
msgstr "Při hodnocení vyberte posouzení šipkami, potvrďte je klávesou Enter a klávesou Tab přecházejte mezi seskupenými odpověďmi. Dokončit hodnocení ukončí posuzování."

msgid "During payment, Z and Shift+Z visit cards that can form a legal payment. They do not select a packet or pay automatically. Escape clears a prepared packet."
msgstr "Během placení Z a Shift+Z procházejí karty, z nichž lze sestavit platnou platbu. Nevybírají sadu ani automaticky neplatí. Escape vymaže připravenou sadu."

msgid "During payment, Z and Shift+Z visit cards that may form a legal payment. They neither select a packet nor pay automatically. Shift+C retains its Biblios meaning and does not sort cards."
msgstr "Při placení přecházejí Z a Shift+Z mezi kartami, které mohou tvořit povolenou platbu. Nevybírají skupinu karet ani automaticky neplatí. Shift+C si zachovává svůj význam ve hře Biblios a netřídí karty."

msgid "During play use the Arrow keys to browse your hand and Enter to play. Press Shift+Enter to declare a marriage when possible; if no marriage is available, the game reports it and does not play the card. Enter on a king or queen with an available marriage opens its choices. Use the surrender action before giving away the first talon card if you want to abandon the deal."
msgstr "Během hry procházejte karty v ruce šipkami a zahrajte je Enterem. Je-li to možné, stiskněte Shift+Enter pro oznámení hlášky; pokud hlášku oznámit nelze, hra to sdělí a kartu nezahraje. Enter na králi nebo dámě s dostupnou hláškou otevře nabídku možností. Pokud chcete rozdání vzdát, použijte příslušnou akci před předáním první karty z talonu."

msgid "During play use the Arrow keys to browse your hand and Enter to play. When a king or queen can declare a marriage, Enter opens a choice between an ordinary play and declaring the marriage. Use the surrender action before giving away the first talon card if you want to abandon the deal."
msgstr "Během hry procházejte karty v ruce šipkami a zahrajte je Enterem. Pokud lze králem nebo dámou oznámit hlášku, Enter nabídne běžné zahrání nebo oznámení hlášky. Pokud chcete rozdání vzdát, použijte příslušnou akci před předáním první karty z talonu."

msgid "During play use the Arrow keys to browse your hand and Enter to play. When a king or queen can declare a marriage, Enter opens its choices and Shift+Enter declares it immediately. Use the surrender action before giving away the first talon card if you want to abandon the deal."
msgstr "Během hry procházejte karty v ruce šipkami a zahrajte je Enterem. Pokud lze králem nebo dámou oznámit hlášku, Enter otevře dostupné možnosti a Shift+Enter ji oznámí okamžitě. Pokud chcete rozdání vzdát, použijte příslušnou akci před předáním první karty z talonu."

#: games/battleship.rb:51
msgid "During play you can browse two boards. Enemy waters show the results of your shots, not the unhit ships. Your waters show your own ships and the shots received. The second board is for inspection: Enter there does not fire. Spectators see two boards named after their owners, with public hit and miss information only."
msgstr ""

msgid "During review, Enter on a card lets the master correct it. A separate approval action closes the review. Ordinary letter keys retain their typing meaning in chat."
msgstr "Při kontrole umožní Enter na kartě hostiteli stolu opravit její výsledek. Samostatná potvrzovací akce kontrolu uzavře. Běžné klávesy s písmeny v chatu nadále slouží k psaní."

msgid "During your auction turn, press Enter on your hand to open the bid list, then choose a bid or pass. After taking the talon, use the Arrow keys and Enter to choose one card for each opponent. Press B only if you want to change the final contract; playing the first card accepts the current contract automatically."
msgstr "Během svého tahu v licitaci stiskněte Enter na kartách v ruce, čímž otevřete seznam nabídek, a poté vyberte nabídku nebo pas. Po dobrání talonu vyberte šipkami a klávesou Enter jednu kartu pro každého soupeře. B stiskněte pouze tehdy, chcete-li změnit konečný závazek; zahrání první karty automaticky přijme aktuální závazek."

msgid "During your auction turn, use the bid list and press Enter to bid or pass. After taking the talon, use the Arrow keys and Enter to choose one card for each opponent. Press B only if you want to change the final contract; playing the first card accepts the current contract automatically."
msgstr "Když jste na řadě v dražbě, použijte seznam nabídek a stiskněte Enter pro nabídnutí částky nebo pasování. Po převzetí talonu vyberte šipkami a klávesou Enter jednu kartu pro každého soupeře. B stiskněte pouze tehdy, chcete-li změnit konečný závazek; zahrání první karty automaticky přijme aktuální závazek."

msgid "E opens a trade form. Choose a player, any number of available properties on either side, and the amounts offered and requested. Enter sends the proposal; the other player accepts with A or rejects with R. Properties in a built-up group and mortgaged properties cannot be traded."
msgstr ""

#: games/monopoly.rb:122
msgid "E: prepare a trade."
msgstr "E: připravte obchod."

msgid "E: prepare a trade. A: accept an incoming offer. R: reject it. During an auction, B enters your own bid and G accepts the suggested bid. Space: request rent when manual collection is awaiting your decision. P: pay to leave jail. J: use a jail card."
msgstr "E: připravit výměnu. A: přijmout příchozí nabídku. R: odmítnout ji. Během aukce B zadá vlastní nabídku a G přijme navrženou nabídku. Space: požadovat nájemné, když ruční výběr čeká na vaše rozhodnutí. P: zaplatit za propuštění z vězení. J: použít kartu pro propuštění z vězení."

#: games/axel_pong.rb:293
msgid "E: read active shields and invisible ball."
msgstr "E: přečtěte aktivní štíty a stav neviditelnosti míčku."

#: games/rummy_ui.rb:159
msgid "E: read card counts."
msgstr "E: přečtěte počty karet."

#: games/makao.rb:104 games/uno.rb:129 games/war.rb:49
msgid "E: read each player's card count."
msgstr "E: přečtěte počet karet každého hráče."

#: games/domino.rb:169 games/mexican_train.rb:130
msgid "E: read hand sizes and the boneyard count."
msgstr "E: přečtěte počet kamenů u hráčů a v zásobě."

#: games/scientific_war.rb:66
msgid "E: read how many cards each player owns."
msgstr ""

#: games/chess.rb:68
msgid "E: read pieces attacking the inspected square."
msgstr "E: přečtěte figury napadající prohlížené pole."

#: games/poker.rb:118
msgid "E: read the community cards."
msgstr "E: přečtěte společné karty."

#: games/scrabble_ui.rb:76
msgid "E: read tile counts."
msgstr "E: přečtěte počty kamenů."

#: lib/game_room_screens.rb:86
msgid "ELTEN Game Room"
msgstr "ELTEN Game Room"

#: games/rummy_ui.rb:117
msgid "Each combination may contain at most one joker and must have at least two natural cards. A joker fills the missing position, but is still read aloud as joker so you can locate it. Selection order matters: joker, 3, 4 of spades means a low run, whereas 3, 4 of spades, joker ends with a five. The game does not rearrange a selected packet to guess what you intended."
msgstr ""

#: games/scrabble_ui.rb:51
msgid "Each language has 100 tiles, including two blanks, but different letter quantities and values. A blank can represent a letter you choose when placing it. It always scores zero and keeps that chosen letter after the move is accepted. It cannot later be changed into another letter or recovered from the board."
msgstr ""

msgid "Each meld permits at most one joker and must contain at least two natural cards. The joker's position determines its identity: joker, three, four represents two; three, four, joker represents five. It is always spoken as joker. Cards are not reordered to repair an invalid selection."
msgstr ""

#: games/audio_ball.rb:205
msgid "Each new point starts at the initial speed. The serve does not add a speed increase; acceleration begins with the next hit."
msgstr ""

msgid "Each other player owes %{player} %{amount}."
msgstr "Každý další hráč dluží hráči %{player} %{amount}."

msgid "Each piece follows the standard chess movement rules. A move that leaves your own king in check is illegal. Castling, en passant and pawn promotion are supported."
msgstr ""

#: games/mancala.rb:55
msgid "Each pit begins with four seeds by default. The table can instead start with any whole number from two to eight in every pit. This changes the total available score: four per pit means 48 seeds altogether. Both players always start equally, and both stores begin empty."
msgstr ""

#: games/mancala.rb:133
msgid "Each pit must start with %{from} to %{to} seeds."
msgstr "Na začátku musí být v každé jamce od %{from} do %{to} semínek."

#: games/spades.rb:215
msgid "Each player declares a number from zero to the size of their hand. You do not have to outbid the previous player. In a team, partners' positive declarations add together into one contract. A declaration of zero, called nil, remains that person's separate promise to win no tricks."
msgstr ""

msgid "Each player declares from zero up to the number of cards in hand. Bids do not have to exceed earlier bids. In a team, the ordinary bids of partners combine into one contract; a zero bid remains an individual nil."
msgstr ""

#: games/axel_pong.rb:253
msgid "Each player hears the court from their own end. A ball to your left sounds on the left; a ball to your right sounds on the right. It grows louder as it approaches you. A side-wall bounce has a higher pitch near your end and a lower pitch near the opponent. Paddle steps also have a pitch cue for position. There is no need to announce every movement: use C when you want to check your paddle's position."
msgstr ""

msgid "Each player receives five cards. After the first betting round, players may exchange up to three cards, followed by the final betting round and showdown."
msgstr ""

msgid "Each player receives two private cards. Betting takes place before the flop, after the flop, after the turn and after the river. The best five-card combination from private and community cards wins."
msgstr ""

#: games/four_in_a_row.rb:33
msgid "Each turn consists of choosing one column. Your piece falls to the lowest empty square in that column. You cannot leave it suspended higher up: if the column is empty, it lands at the bottom; if it already holds two pieces, yours rests on top of them. A full column cannot accept another piece."
msgstr ""

msgid "Each two adds two penalty cards and each three adds three. Twos and threes may answer each other is on in the ready-made profiles: the debt accumulates, for example two plus three means five. With this option off, only another card of the same attacking rank answers. A player who accepts the debt draws its full amount and ends the turn."
msgstr ""

msgid "Each two adds two penalty cards and each three adds three. Twos and threes may answer each other is on in the ready-made profiles: the debt accumulates, for example two plus three means five. With this option off, only another card of the same attacking rank answers. A player with no legal defence automatically draws the full debt and ends the turn."
msgstr ""

