msgstr "Prázdná pozice ve stojánku."

#: games/chess.rb:60
msgid "En passant is a special pawn capture. If an opposing pawn advances two squares and finishes beside your pawn, you may capture it as though it had advanced only one. Move diagonally to the square it passed through. This opportunity exists only on your very next move; if you play something else, it is gone."
msgstr ""

msgid "En passant is available only immediately after an opposing pawn advances two fields and finishes beside your pawn. Move your pawn diagonally to the field that opposing pawn passed; that pawn is captured even though the destination was empty."
msgstr ""

