msgid "End each turn by choosing one unused category. The list shows the points you would receive, including zero when the dice do not satisfy that category. Once used, a category cannot be changed or used again in that match. After everyone fills the sheet, the highest total wins, or the selected next match starts. Tied highest totals share the result."
msgstr ""

