msgid "H: build houses or hotels."
msgstr "H: stavte domy nebo hotely."

msgid "H: hand. C: trick cards. Ctrl+C: browse them. F: trump. S: scores. Shift+S: zeroes, surrenders and barrel chances. T: whose turn it is."
msgstr "H: karty v ruce. C: karty ve zdvihu. Ctrl+C: jejich procházení. F: trumf. S: skóre. Shift+S: nuly, vzdání a šance na sudu. T: kdo je na tahu."

#: games/poker.rb:115
msgid "H: read who is still in and who has folded."
msgstr "H: přečtěte, kdo ještě hraje a kdo složil karty."

#: games/ninety_nine.rb:98 games/three_five_eight.rb:97 games/tysiac.rb:107
msgid "H: read your hand."
msgstr "H: přečtěte karty v ruce."

msgid "H: your hand. C: shared total. S: everyone's tokens. T: whose turn it is. Replacement cards are drawn automatically."
msgstr "H: vaše karty v ruce. C: společný součet. S: žetony všech hráčů. T: kdo je na tahu. Náhradní karty se dobírají automaticky."

#: lib/game_room_ping.rb:51
msgid "HTTP ping is unavailable."
msgstr "Měření odezvy HTTP není dostupné."

#: lib/game_room_ping.rb:53
msgid "HTTP ping: %{milliseconds} ms."
msgstr "Ping HTTP: %{milliseconds} ms."

#: games/poker.rb:18
msgid "Half-pot limit"
msgstr "Limit poloviny banku"

msgid "Hand and reactions"
msgstr "Karty v ruce a reakce"

msgid "Hand, prepared melds and table controls"
msgstr "Karty v ruce, připravené kombinace a ovládání stolu"

msgid "Hands continue with a rotating dealer until only one player has chips."
msgstr ""

#: games/poker.rb:154
msgid "Hands or minutes between blind increases"
msgstr "Počet rozdání nebo minut mezi zvýšeními blindů"

#: games/axel_pong.rb:32
msgid "Hard"
msgstr "Těžká"

#: games/categories.rb:145
msgid "Hard, 27 categories"
msgstr "Těžká, 27 kategorií"

#: games/audio_ball.rb:202
msgid "Hard: the first full flight takes 0.9 seconds."
msgstr ""

#: games/audio_ball.rb:187
msgid "Hard: the first full flight takes 0.9 seconds. Each later hit in the rally increases the current speed by 8%."
msgstr ""

#: games/war.rb:467
msgid "Hidden cards of %{player}: %{cards}."
msgstr ""

msgid "Hidro-elektrana Đerdap"
msgstr "Vodní elektrárna Đerdap"

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:190
msgid "History and F1 help are now read-only text fields, with normal text navigation, selection and copying. Each help shortcut has its own line. Enter or Escape closes help."
msgstr "Historie a nápověda pod F1 jsou nyní textová pole pouze pro čtení s běžným pohybem po textu, označováním a kopírováním. Každá zkratka v nápovědě má vlastní řádek. Enter nebo Escape nápovědu zavře."

#: games/poker.rb:103
msgid "Hold'em uses blinds: forced bets made before seeing the hand develop. The small blind defaults to 5 and the big blind to 10. Both must be positive, and the big blind cannot be smaller. Five-card draw normally uses an ante of 5 from everyone instead. Its amount must be positive and no greater than the starting stack. Use blinds in five-card draw replaces that ante with blinds. Even with ante, the base big-blind value supplies the minimum betting unit."
msgstr ""

#: games/biblios.rb:1210
msgid "Holy Books"
msgstr "Posvátné knihy"

msgid "Houses, hotels and selling evenly"
msgstr ""

#: games/scrabble_ui.rb:52
msgid "How a move earns points"
msgstr ""

msgid "How each piece moves"
msgstr ""

#: games/farkle.rb:41
msgid "How far do you dare to roll?"
msgstr ""

#: games/mancala.rb:123
msgid "How hard the computer plays"
msgstr "Síla počítačového hráče"

#: games/mancala.rb:56
msgid "How sowing works"
msgstr ""

msgid "How the cards change the total"
msgstr ""

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:22
msgid "How to play"
msgstr ""

#: games/battleship.rb:650
msgid "How would you like to arrange your fleet?"
msgstr "Jak chcete rozmístit svou flotilu?"

#: lib/game_statistics_screen.rb:52
msgid "Humans only"
msgstr ""

msgid "Hydro Power Plant"
msgstr "Vodní elektrárna"

#: games/scrabble_ui.rb:71
msgid "I: cycle receipt, alphabetic and vowel-first order after clearing the draft."
msgstr "I: po vymazání rozehraného tahu přepínejte řazení podle pořadí dobrání, podle abecedy nebo se samohláskami na začátku."

#: games/monopoly.rb:109
msgid "I: read player positions and field numbers."
msgstr "I: přečtěte pozice hráčů a čísla polí."

#: games/poker.rb:114
msgid "I: read your investment in this hand."
msgstr "I: přečtěte svůj vklad v tomto rozdání."

#: games/spades.rb:237
msgid "I: read your progress in the round."
msgstr "I: přečtěte svůj průběžný výsledek v kole."

msgid "Identical answers in the same category are grouped and shown with all their authors. The judge, not the program, decides whether a group is unique, duplicated or incorrect."
msgstr ""

msgid "Identical answers in the same category are grouped. The judge decides whether they make sense, fit the category and letter, and deserve acceptance. A unique correct answer gives 2 points; a partially correct answer or an accepted repeated answer gives 1 per author; a rejected or empty answer gives 0. These decisions are made by the judge, not an automatic dictionary."
msgstr ""

msgid "Identical answers in the same category are grouped. The judge, not the program, decides whether a single answer is unique, partially correct or incorrect, and whether an identical group is accepted or incorrect."
msgstr ""

#: games/categories.rb:779
msgid "Identical, 1 point"
msgstr "Shodná, 1 bod"

msgid "Identical, 5 points"
msgstr "Shodná, 5 bodů"

#: games/rummy.rb:42
msgid "Identities — identical cards may form a meld"
msgstr "Totožné karty – shodné karty mohou tvořit kombinaci"

#: games/rummy_ui.rb:118
msgid "Identities, off by default, also permits three or four identical cards: the same rank and suit from different decks. This is different from an ordinary set, whose suits must differ. An identity combination gains an extra 10 points per card when scoring melds; the elimination mode still does not award points for melds."
msgstr ""

#: games/farkle.rb:44
msgid "If a roll contains no scoring combination, you have farkled: you lose the entire current turn total and play passes on. Your earlier banked score is unaffected. If you manage to score with all six dice, you may roll all six again and continue building the same turn total. This is called hot dice."
msgstr ""

msgid "If another player takes the contract and surrenders before playing, the barrel player's remaining chances do not decrease. A player already on the barrel cannot surrender. Changing the target score also moves the barrel threshold: it remains 120 below that target."
msgstr ""

#: games/mancala.rb:66
msgid "If that final empty pit is yours and the opposite pit contains seeds, capture all the seeds opposite together with your own last seed. Both pits become empty. For example, three seeds opposite plus your last seed give you four points. Landing on the opposing side or opposite an empty pit gives no capture."
msgstr ""

msgid "If the leaders are tied after that round, another complete round is played until a single player leads."
msgstr ""

#: games/scientific_war.rb:57
msgid "If the trick would end in a war, the joker prevents it and the player who played it wins the trick. If there would be no war, the joker causes one: nobody takes the trick and the cards stay on the table. If two or more jokers are played in the same trick, none of them has any effect."
msgstr ""

msgid "If two or more players are tied, the player with the most Gold wins. If there is still a tie, the higher total in the Monk category decides, then the tie-breaking letter, then the next category on the Scriptorium."
msgstr ""

#: games/war.rb:38
msgid "If two or more players share the highest card, a war starts between them. Each of them places one hidden card and then plays the next card face up. The highest of the new cards takes everything from the table, including the hidden cards and the cards of players who did not take part in the war. If the new cards are equal again, the war continues in the same way. When a war is won, the winner hears every hidden card taken, first the opponents' and then their own, and then the other cards from the table."
msgstr ""

#: games/scientific_war.rb:50
msgid "If two or more strongest cards are equal, there is a war and nobody takes the trick. The cards stay on the table, and whoever wins the next trick takes them as well. If there are several wars in a row, more and more cards wait on the table."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you are in debt, the main field still contains only Roll the dice. Trying it reports the missing amount; use the existing property and trade shortcuts, then try again."
msgstr "Pokud máte dluh, hlavní pole stále obsahuje pouze Hodit kostkami. Při pokusu o tuto akci se oznámí chybějící částka; použijte stávající zkratky pro správu nemovitostí a výměnu a poté to zkuste znovu."

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:15
msgid "If you are the table host, you choose the game variant."
msgstr ""

#: games/mexican_train.rb:118
msgid "If you cannot cover the required double, draw. If you still cannot, open your own train and pass; the obligation remains for the next player. A non-double play normally ends your turn. There is one important ending exception: if your final hand tile is a double, you win the round immediately without having to cover it."
msgstr ""

#: games/three_five_eight.rb:85
msgid "If you cannot follow, you may play any card. You do not have to play a trump or overtrump. No-trump and misere deals have no trump suit."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you cannot pay, Roll remains visible but reports how much money is missing. Sell buildings, mortgage property or arrange a trade, then continue. Bankruptcy is a deliberate final action."
msgstr ""

#: games/audio_ball.rb:216
msgid "If you have fond memories of the old game Audiodisc, you can bring back its sounds here. Under Ctrl+P, change Sound pack from Default to Sounds from Audiodisc. This replaces the three flight sounds, preparation, stopping the ball after a successful defence and the goal effect. Score recordings stay the same. The audio tutorial uses your selected pack too. The choice is yours alone: other players can use a different pack in the same match."
msgstr ""

#: games/makao.rb:78
msgid "If you have no legal defence, the program takes the whole drawing penalty for you and ends your turn. A drawing attack targets the next seat, including a player who is waiting after a four. A waiting player cannot defend: they draw automatically, using up one of their waiting turns. The attack does not bounce back to its author merely because the next player is waiting."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you have no legal move, the game announces and skips your turn automatically. You cannot pass voluntarily when a move exists. When neither player can move, the game counts the discs: more discs wins, equal numbers draw. The board need not be full. There are no optional variants; computers are supported."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you have no legal move, your turn is passed automatically. The game ends when neither player can move."
msgstr ""

#: games/krowa.rb:102
msgid "If you leave the table, today's Daily Krowa will remain unavailable even if you have not guessed the word or surrendered. Are you sure you want to leave?"
msgstr "Pokud opustíte stůl, dnešní Denní Krowa zůstane nedostupná, a to i bez uhodnutí slova nebo vzdání hry. Opravdu chcete odejít?"

#: games/axel_pong.rb:32
msgid "Impossible"
msgstr "Nemožná"

#: games/audio_ball.rb:188
msgid "Impossible: the first full flight takes 0.6 seconds. Each later hit in the rally increases the current speed by 4%."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:214
msgid "Improved Axel Pong connection setup and recovery, including starting another match at the same table. Repeated connection invitations no longer interfere with an already accepted connection."
msgstr "Vylepšeno navazování a obnovování připojení v Axel Pong, včetně zahájení dalšího zápasu u stejného stolu. Opakované pozvánky k připojení již nenarušují připojení, které bylo přijato."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:200
msgid "Improved Polish UNO card names and removed commas between colour and value. Playing a buzzer card now has its own sound; announcing UNO keeps its existing sound."
msgstr "Byly vylepšeny polské názvy karet UNO a odstraněny čárky mezi barvou a hodnotou. Zahrání karty s bzučákem má nyní vlastní zvuk; ohlášení UNO si ponechává dosavadní zvuk."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:230
msgid "Improved communication in Axel Pong matches with bots, in both Singles and Doubles. Adding a bot no longer routes human serves and returns through the table owner's computer."
msgstr "Byla vylepšena komunikace v zápasech Axel Pong s boty, a to ve dvouhře i čtyřhře. Přidání bota již nezpůsobuje přenos podání a odrazů lidských hráčů přes počítač hostitele stolu."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:284
msgid "Improved rejoining tables and updating participants, hands and turns after replacing a player or changing the table master."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:135
msgid "In 99, exceeding the turn-time limit costs one token and passes the turn to the next player."
msgstr "Ve hře 99 stojí překročení časového limitu tahu jeden žeton a tah přechází na dalšího hráče."

#: games/ninety_nine.rb:79
msgid "In 99, two to eight players change a shared total by playing cards. You want to protect your tokens and make other players lose theirs. Each round starts with three cards per player and a total of zero. After your play, if the round continues, you automatically receive a replacement card."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:223
msgid "In Axel Pong Doubles, announcing the server and receiver no longer holds the match until speech finishes. This removes a cause of long pauses after a server change. The normal 2.7-second pause applies, as in Singles."
msgstr "Ve hře Axel Pong Doubles už oznámení podávajícího a přijímajícího hráče nezdržuje zápas až do skončení řeči. Odstraňuje se tím jedna z příčin dlouhých přestávek po změně podávajícího. Platí běžná přestávka 2,7 sekundy, stejně jako ve dvouhře."

#: games/biblios.rb:54
msgid "In Biblios, two to four players compete to build the most valuable monastery library. Collect cards in five categories: Pigments, Monks, Forbidden Tomes, Holy Books and Manuscripts. Cards have values and letters. The total value in a category determines who wins that category, but the die on the Scriptorium determines how many victory points it is worth. Each die starts at 3 and can later range from 1 to 6."
msgstr ""

#: games/checkers.rb:107
msgid "In Checkers, two players try to leave the opponent without a piece or without a legal move. Only dark squares are used. White starts at the bottom and moves first. An ordinary piece, called a man, normally moves one empty square diagonally towards the far side of the board."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:199
msgid "In Doubles, the first player on each team uses a distinct footstep recording without an extra pitch shift. Their serves and returns are four semitones lower. Missing Polish Doubles messages have also been translated."
msgstr "Ve čtyřhře používá první hráč každého týmu odlišnou nahrávku kroků bez další změny výšky tónu. Jeho podání a vracení míčku znějí o čtyři půltóny níže. Byly také doplněny chybějící polské překlady zpráv pro čtyřhru."

msgid "In Game Room, F1 opens a shortcuts list browsed with the arrow keys; Enter or Escape closes it. F2 lowers and F3 raises the selected sound group's volume by 10 percentage points. Shift+F2/F3 selects a sound group. All Game Room sounds is the master level; individual game, room, chat and notification levels remain separate. Speech and other ELTEN sounds are not affected."
msgstr "V Game Roomu F1 otevře seznam zkratek, který lze procházet šipkami; Enter nebo Escape jej zavře. F2 sníží a F3 zvýší hlasitost vybrané skupiny zvuků o 10 procentních bodů. Shift+F2/F3 vybere skupinu zvuků. Všechny zvuky Game Roomu představují hlavní úroveň hlasitosti; jednotlivé úrovně hry, místnosti, chatu a oznámení zůstávají oddělené. Řeč a ostatní zvuky ELTENu nejsou ovlivněny."

#: games/monopoly.rb:81
msgid "In Game Room, a negative balance ends your current turn. The other players take their turns before your next one begins. Then you can sell buildings, mortgage properties or arrange a trade to cover the shortfall. Roll remains the main action, but tells you how much is missing instead of rolling while the balance is negative. A payment charged outside your turn does not interrupt the current player's move."
msgstr ""

#: games/mancala.rb:70
msgid "In Kalah you sow into your own store as you pass it, immediately scoring that seed. Skip only the opponent's store; on a full circuit your original pit can receive seeds again. Landing the last seed in your store gives you another move. You may earn several extra moves in succession."
msgstr ""

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:12
msgid "In Krowa, your task is to guess a Polish noun. At the very beginning, a word is drawn and you are told how many letters it has. You enter guesses with the same number of letters as the secret word. After each attempt, you hear how many letters occupy the same positions in both words. If the answer is kot and you enter sok, you get 1 out of 3: only the middle letter matches. K is not counted because it is the first letter in kot but the third in sok."
msgstr ""

msgid "In Ludo, 1 reads your pawns and 2, 3 and 4 read the other players in seating order. D says who rolled last and the number. Shift+V lists all pawns together in shared-track order, followed by home lanes, bases and finished pawns, making nearby pawns easier to compare."
msgstr "Ve hře Člověče, nezlob se přečte 1 vaše figurky a 2, 3 a 4 figurky ostatních hráčů podle pořadí u stolu. D oznámí, kdo házel naposledy a jaké číslo hodil. Shift+V zobrazí všechny figurky společně v pořadí polí společné dráhy, následované cílovými drahami, základnami a figurkami v cíli, což usnadňuje porovnání blízkých figurek."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:173
msgid "In Ludo, 1 reads your pawns and 2, 3 and 4 read the other players' pawns. D says who rolled last and the number. Shift+V lists pawns in board-position order instead of grouping them by player."
msgstr "Ve hře Člověče, nezlob se klávesa 1 přečte vaše figurky a klávesy 2, 3 a 4 figurky ostatních hráčů. D oznámí, kdo házel naposledy a jaké číslo padlo. Shift+V vypíše figurky podle jejich pozice na desce místo seskupení podle hráčů."

msgid "In Polish, use Shift+AltGr with A, C, E, L, N, O, S, X or Z for Ą, Ć, Ę, Ł, Ń, Ó, Ś, Ź or Ż."
msgstr "V polštině použijte Shift+AltGr s klávesami A, C, E, L, N, O, S, X nebo Z pro písmena Ą, Ć, Ę, Ł, Ń, Ó, Ś, Ź nebo Ż."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:231
msgid "In Pong matches with bots, the goal sound no longer waits for the score to be saved on the server. All participants in these matches need this update."
msgstr "V zápasech Pong s boty už zvuk gólu nečeká na uložení skóre na server. Všichni účastníci těchto zápasů potřebují tuto aktualizaci."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:198
msgid "In Pong matches with bots, your own paddle steps respond locally instead of waiting for a network round trip, improving their smoothness for guests."
msgstr "V zápasech hry Pong s boty se kroky vaší pálky přehrávají místně, bez čekání na odeslání pohybu a přijetí odpovědi přes síť. Hostům stolu to zajišťuje plynulejší odezvu."

msgid "In Pong, Left and Right move the paddle; Up or Space serves and hits. Mouse control is always active in the playfield: move left or right and use the left button to serve or hit. It does not take over the mouse in chat, menus, help or other applications."
msgstr "V Pongu šipky vlevo a vpravo pohybují pálkou; šipka nahoru nebo Space podá a odpálí míček. Ovládání myší je v herním poli vždy aktivní: pohybujte myší doleva nebo doprava a levým tlačítkem podávejte nebo odpalujte. Hra nepřebírá ovládání myši v chatu, nabídkách, nápovědě ani jiných aplikacích."

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:20
msgid "In Race, everyone guesses independently. With time scoring, the shortest time from the start of the word to the correct submission wins; the clock is synchronized with the server and waiting for verification does not increase the result. With attempt scoring, the fewest valid attempts wins. Equal results are a shared win."
msgstr ""

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:26
msgid "In Race, everyone guesses independently. You can set the word length or leave it to chance. Either way, you can draw another word, which resets the attempts. You can also set the winning criterion mentioned above:"
msgstr ""

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:29
msgid "In Race, if everyone else has guessed either faster than you or in fewer attempts, the game ends and the word is revealed to you."
msgstr ""

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:31
msgid "In Random word, the Draw another word button lets you replace the current word without creating another table. You can use it before the first attempt or later, after submitted attempts have been checked. The previous solution is revealed and the attempts reset; this is not a win and gives no gallery or leaderboard result. Only the player can use it, not observers. The Race host has a similar button that resets every player's attempts and time. Neither Daily Krowa nor Word Tower allows rerolling."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:281
msgid "In Settings > General, choose whether game announcements and the sound for your turn are heard outside the table window. The same settings apply in other ELTEN windows and when you switch to another program."
msgstr ""

#: games/axel_pong.rb:256
msgid "In Single, the first server is chosen at the start of a human match; against a bot, the human starts. Service changes after every two completed points. After a point there is a three-second break for the goal recording, followed by the score and a further 2.7-second serve delay. You can reposition your paddle during this pause, but serving requires a new press after it ends."
msgstr ""

#: games/axel_pong.rb:219
msgid "In Single, the first server is chosen at the start of a human match; against a bot, the human starts. Service changes after every two completed points. Choose a target of 7, 11 or 21, with a lead of at least two points required to win. At 10–10 in an 11-point match, 11–10 is not enough; 12–10 wins. After a point there is a three-second break for the goal recording, followed by the score and a further 2.7-second serve delay. You can reposition your paddle during this pause, but serving requires a new press after it ends."
msgstr ""

#: games/taboo_ui.rb:79
msgid "In Taboo, your team guesses a word from your spoken clues. The difficulty is that you may not say the word itself or any of the five forbidden words printed with it. Game Room handles cards, time and points, but does not transmit, record or judge speech. Connect through an ELTEN conference or another voice application, or play in person with headphones. Do not share the sound or screen reading the secret card."
msgstr ""

#: games/tic_tac_toe.rb:31
msgid "In Tic-tac-toe, two players try to make a line of three of their own marks. The board has three rows and three columns. The first player uses X and makes the first move; the other uses O."
msgstr ""

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:30
msgid "In Word Tower, you take turns, and guessing the word starts another round. Words have 3 to 8 letters, and the shared attempt limit is the word length multiplied by 8. The tower ends when you run out of attempts or the host gives up. Your score is the number of completed rounds. The round list in the leaderboard contains the words and attempt counts."
msgstr ""

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:21
msgid "In Word Tower, you take turns. Words have 3 to 8 letters and the shared attempt limit is the word length multiplied by 8. Guessing the word starts another round with a different word. History and the current turn are shared."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:174
msgid "In Yahtzee, D reads only the dice values. Clarified the rules and the bonus for Ones through Sixes; Misery now has a Polish name."
msgstr "Ve hře Yahtzee klávesa D přečte pouze hodnoty kostek. Byla upřesněna pravidla a bonus za jedničky až šestky; Misery má nyní polský název."

msgid "In Yahtzee, D reads only the dice values. The bonus for reaching 63 points in Ones through Sixes has a clearer name and explanation, without referring to the upper part of a sheet. The Polish Misery category is now called Nedza, and the opening rules are clearer."
msgstr "V Yahtzee nyní D přečte pouze hodnoty kostek. Bonus za dosažení 63 bodů v kategoriích Jedničky až Šestky má srozumitelnější název a vysvětlení bez odkazu na horní část tabulky. Polská kategorie Misery se nyní jmenuje Nedza a úvod pravidel je srozumitelnější."

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:19
msgid "In a single-player Daily Krowa or Random word game, the add button stores the entered noun in the user's dictionary and immediately checks it as an attempt. The button is unavailable in multiplayer. The person adding a word is responsible for it being a noun. Solutions are drawn from the shared database."
msgstr ""

msgid "In an auction the list offers Pass and a range of bids; a bid you cannot cover is marked, because you may bid more than you hold and accept the penalty. R bids any other amount. To pay, use Shift+Enter to add each card to the packet and Enter to send it, or choose Do not pay from the same list."
msgstr ""

#: games/three_five_eight.rb:91
msgid "In an ordinary deal the dealer's target is 3 tricks, the player to the dealer's right needs 5, and the chooser to the dealer's left needs 8. Your score for the deal is tricks won minus your target. The three changes therefore always total zero."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:136
msgid "In both Poker variants, exceeding the time limit folds your hand. During the draw, an all-in player instead keeps their cards and remains in the showdown. Side pots are also settled correctly when players fold during the draw."
msgstr "V obou variantách pokeru překročení časového limitu znamená složení karet. Při výměně si však hráč, který vsadil vše, karty ponechá a dál se účastní závěrečného odkrytí karet. Vedlejší banky se nyní správně vyhodnocují i tehdy, když hráči během výměny složí karty."

msgid "In both variants, distribute any indivisible chips clockwise among tied winners starting to the left of the dealer. Apply this separately to each pot."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:41 lib/game_room_changelog.rb:51
msgid "In card games, Z and Shift+Z move to the next or previous playable card. A single unambiguous card may be played automatically. UNO disables this aid when Straights, Interceptions, Super interceptions by value or Buzzer cards are enabled."
msgstr "V karetních hrách přejdete pomocí Z a Shift+Z na další nebo předchozí hratelnou kartu. Jediná jednoznačně hratelná karta se může zahrát automaticky. V UNO je tato pomůcka vypnutá, pokud jsou povoleny postupky, přebírání tahu, pokročilé přebírání tahu podle hodnoty nebo karty se bzučákem."

msgid "In draw poker, choose cards with the Arrow keys. Shift+Enter adds or removes cards from the exchange packet, then Enter exchanges it, also including the current card if not already selected. The Keep all cards action completes the exchange phase without discarding anything."
msgstr "V pokeru s výměnou karet vybírejte karty šipkami. Shift+Enter přidá karty do sady k výměně nebo je z ní odebere a Enter ji vymění; zahrne také aktuální kartu, pokud dosud nebyla vybrána. Akce Ponechat všechny karty ukončí fázi výměny bez odhození jakékoli karty."

#: games/scientific_war.rb:46
msgid "In each trick everyone chooses a card at the same time. Nobody can see your card until everyone has chosen; then all the cards are turned face up together. Do not leave the table before your card is revealed, because the trick waits for it."
msgstr ""

#: games/rummy_ui.rb:136
msgid "In either scoring mode, the score limit can be any whole number from 1 to 100000. Changing it alters when the match ends, not the values of cards or penalties."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:279
msgid "In games that support bots, a player who leaves is automatically replaced by a bot. They return as an observer, and the table master can give them a seat again."
msgstr ""

msgid "In normal mode you score cards you place on the table. Taking a card subtracts its old table value from your score; laying it down again adds its new value. Replacing a joker with an equal natural card gives no artificial extra points. The round winner also receives the value of all opponents' remaining cards."
msgstr ""

#: games/rummy_ui.rb:137
msgid "In normal mode, earn points for your melded and laid-off cards. The player who empties their hand also receives the value of the cards remaining in the other hands. Finishing in the same turn as your first meld is a rummy: it adds 200 points, or 300 instead if you use only your own hand without laying off or borrowing from the table. Doing this before anyone else has made a first meld adds another 100."
msgstr ""

#: games/scrabble_ui.rb:48
msgid "In one move, place your new letters in a single row or column. Existing letters may fill the spaces between them, but the completed line cannot have empty gaps. Words read left to right or top to bottom, never diagonally. You may extend a word, cross it, or place letters beside it to make several shorter words. Every newly created word must be valid, not just the longest one. Accepted letters stay in place for the rest of the game."
msgstr ""

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:16
msgid "In solo mode, you have two options: Daily Krowa, with a new word each day that is the same for everyone, or Random word, where you can choose the word length. In both modes, you have one superpower. You can add words to a dictionary that stores your nouns locally. Hmmm... if you put asdfasdfasdf in there, it will be stored too, but I hope having fun matters more than racking up leaderboard scores. So, if you want to use smerfy as a guess, just press \"Add noun to dictionary and check\". You will not be able to use that word in multiplayer modes, though. Not because I dislike the Smurfs; it is simply not in the database."
msgstr ""

msgid "In standard scoring, making a regular contract gives 10 points for every bid trick plus 1 point for every overtrick. Missing it gives minus 10 times the bid. Overtricks are already part of the displayed score; every accumulated tenth overtrick also causes a 100 point penalty."
msgstr ""

#: games/poker.rb:83
msgid "In the default variant, each player receives two private cards. First you bet without any cards on the board. The flop then reveals three community cards, followed by another betting round. The turn adds one card and another betting round; the river adds the fifth and final community card, followed by the last betting round. The game announces each stage and the newly revealed cards."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_rules.rb:67
msgid "In-game keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "Klávesové zkratky ve hře"

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:120
msgid "In-game keyboard shortcuts are now an arrow-key list. During a game, it uses the same current game-field help as F1. Enter or Escape closes the list; rules remain one document with headings."
msgstr "Klávesové zkratky ve hře mají nyní podobu seznamu ovládaného šipkami. Během hry se v něm používá stejná aktuální nápověda herního pole jako pod F1. Enter nebo Escape seznam zavře; pravidla zůstávají jedním dokumentem s nadpisy."

