msgstr "K otevření pokeru s výměnou je potřeba alespoň pár kluků"

msgid "Jacks or better is required to open draw poker is off by default. When enabled, opening the first betting round with a bet requires at least a pair of jacks or any stronger combination. It does not prevent a weaker hand from calling an existing bet and does not apply to the second betting round."
