msgstr "Dámy se pohybují a berou na libovolnou vzdálenost"

msgid "Kings move and capture over any distance is on by default. A flying king travels along a clear diagonal and captures an opposing piece with an empty landing field beyond it; it cannot jump over several occupied fields in one jump. Disable this option for kings that move one field and capture by a short jump. Kings can move and capture in both directions."
msgstr ""

#: games/checkers.rb:117
msgid "Kings move and capture over any distance is on by default. Such a king travels along a clear diagonal and may land on an empty square beyond the opposing piece it jumps. It cannot jump two occupied squares in a single jump. If the setting is off, a king moves one square or makes a short capture jump, still in either direction."
msgstr ""

