msgstr ""

#: games/yahtzee.rb:287
msgid "Ones through Sixes: %{points} of 63."
msgstr "Jedničky až šestky: %{points} z 63."

#: games/yahtzee.rb:62
msgid "Ones, Twos, Threes, Fours, Fives and Sixes count only dice with that value. For example, 2, 2, 4, 4, 6 gives 4 in Twos, 8 in Fours or 6 in Sixes. Their combined score can earn the bonus described below."
msgstr ""

msgid "Ones, Twos, Threes, Fours, Fives and Sixes count only dice with that value. For example, 2, 2, 4, 4, 6 gives 4 in Twos, 8 in Fours or 6 in Sixes. These six rows form the upper section."
