#: games/farkle.rb:45
msgid "Only dice from the same roll can form a combination. For example, a one saved from an earlier roll cannot be added to two new ones to make a triple. You may combine several scoring groups from the current roll, but every selected die must belong to a valid group. The program does not let you attach a useless die just to get rid of it."
msgstr ""

