#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:107 lib/game_room_changelog.rb:85
msgid "Reversi adds optional passing even when a move exists and optional play without capturing. A non-capturing move must still touch an existing disc. P passes; voluntary passes alone do not end the game. Bots follow the selected rules."
msgstr "V Reversi lze nově povolit vynechání tahu i tehdy, když je tah možný, a také hru bez braní. Kámen položený bez braní musí stále sousedit s některým již položeným kamenem. Klávesa P vynechá tah; samotné dobrovolné vynechávání tahů hru neukončí. Boti dodržují zvolená pravidla."

#: games/reversi.rb:49
msgid "Reversi is played by two people on an 8 by 8 board. Four discs are already in the centre: two black and two white. The first player is black and starts. Unlike in many board games, captured discs stay on the board and change colour. You want more discs of your colour when the game ends, not necessarily after every move."
