msgid "Rummy is a game for two to eight players. Each receives fourteen cards. Two decks are used for two to four players, three for five or six, and four for seven or eight; every deck includes two jokers. The Identities option always uses four decks. Your main task is to place cards in valid combinations and eventually empty your hand."
