msgid "Sell in reverse order, from the most developed streets, for half the building price. The bank's supply is finite: normally 32 houses and 12 hotels on 40 fields, or 48 and 18 on 60 fields. Replacing a hotel with four houses requires those houses in the bank. If they are missing, the list instead explicitly offers selling all buildings in that colour group at half price."
msgstr ""

#: games/monopoly.rb:73
