msgid "Tab and Shift+Tab move through the answer, add-to-dictionary button in solo play, attempts, results, chat, history, users, and game commands. Word Tower also includes the current turn. Lists support arrow keys and letter navigation. Enter checks the typed word; Enter or Space activates buttons."
