msgid "The shared bot move delay defaults to one second in Makao. You may announce or catch Makao during the computer's turn, including its waiting time."
msgstr ""

msgid "The shared track has 52 numbered fields. After field 52 comes field 1, so every player travels the same distance despite starting at a different number."
msgstr ""

msgid "The shared track has 52 numbered fields. Each player then enters a private six-field home lane; reaching its end places the pawn at the finish, where it no longer moves."
msgstr ""

#: games/ludo.rb:70
msgid "The shared track has 52 squares. Players enter at squares 1, 14, 27 and 40 in seating order. The numbering wraps from 52 back to 1, so everyone travels the same distance. After the shared track, each pawn enters its owner's private six-square home lane. Opponents cannot enter that lane. Its last square is the finish, and a finished pawn does not move again."
msgstr ""

#: games/battleship.rb:324 games/battleship.rb:671
msgid "The ship does not fit there."
msgstr "Loď se sem nevejde."

#: lib/game_room_screens.rb:420
msgid "The shortcut could not be saved. Please try again."
msgstr "Klávesovou zkratku se nepodařilo uložit. Zkuste to prosím znovu."

#: __app.rb:3125
msgid "The sound volume could not be saved."
msgstr "Hlasitost zvuků se nepodařilo uložit."

#: games/axel_pong.rb:263
msgid "The starting team is chosen once for the match. Each service block lasts two points. For teams A and B against C and D, the first cycle is A to C, D to B, B to D, C to A. The next cycle is A to D, C to B, B to C, D to A; then these cycles repeat. If the other team starts, exchange the teams' roles. Within every rally, the order is server, receiver, server's partner, receiver's partner, repeated until the point ends. Both partners share their team's points and victory."
msgstr ""

msgid "The station and trains"
msgstr ""

msgid "The table and score use Game Room's normal session. Fast movement uses a separate Communications channel. If current updates stop arriving, play pauses rather than running through the missing time. A replaced connection restarts the unfinished rally from the last confirmed score. Spectators can listen but cannot control a paddle. This game does not currently support saving an unfinished match."
msgstr "Stůl a skóre používají běžnou relaci Game Roomu. Rychlý pohyb využívá samostatný kanál Communications. Pokud přestanou přicházet aktuální údaje, hra se pozastaví, místo aby doháněla chybějící čas. Po obnovení spojení začne nedokončená výměna znovu od posledního potvrzeného skóre. Pozorovatelé mohou poslouchat, ale nemohou ovládat pálku. Tato hra v současnosti nepodporuje uložení nedokončeného zápasu."

#: games/axel_pong.rb:280
msgid "The table and score use Game Room's normal session; movement uses Communications. During a human match, each player calculates their own flight and return locally. Lost or delayed paddle-position updates alone do not stop the ball. Serves, returns and misses travel separately in order. An actual connection failure pauses the rally; a replacement connection restarts the unfinished point with the confirmed score unchanged. Observers may listen but cannot control a paddle. Unfinished matches cannot currently be saved."
msgstr ""

#: __app.rb:2889 __app.rb:3030 __app.rb:3049
msgid "The table changed while you were editing. Open its settings again."
msgstr "Během úprav se stůl změnil. Otevřete jeho nastavení znovu."

#: lib/game_room_widget.rb:172
msgid "The table could not be created. Please try again."
msgstr "Stůl se nepodařilo vytvořit. Zkuste to znovu."

#: lib/game_room_widget.rb:279
msgid "The table could not be opened. Please try again."
msgstr "Stůl se nepodařilo otevřít. Zkuste to znovu."

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:36
msgid "The table creator can save a Race or Word Tower while a word is being guessed, once all submitted attempts have been checked. The local save lets you resume the game with the same players at a new table. Solo games cannot be saved for later."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:62
msgid "The table creator can save an ongoing game locally with Ctrl+S, closing the table. Saved games replaces rankings in the main menu."
msgstr "Hostitel stolu může klávesami Ctrl+S uložit probíhající partii do svého zařízení, čímž se stůl uzavře. Položka Uložené hry nahrazuje v hlavní nabídce žebříčky."

msgid "The table creator may choose an 8, 10 or 12 square board and independently change the capture, king, movement and promotion rules. Leaving every option unchanged starts the classic 8 by 8 game."
msgstr ""

msgid "The table creator may enable interceptions, hand swapping with zero and seven, drawing until a playable card, and the No Mercy hand-size limit. Interceptions are individual live card actions, so another player can react before normal play continues."
msgstr ""

msgid "The table form shows only settings relevant to the chosen variant. Length is available in Random word and Race; the scoring criterion appears only in Race. Daily Krowa and Word Tower select their own lengths."
msgstr ""

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:30
msgid "The table form shows only settings relevant to the chosen variant. Number of letters is available in Random word and Race; Scoring criterion appears only in Race. Daily Krowa and Word Tower select their own lengths and hide both settings."
msgstr ""

#: games/domino.rb:192 lib/game_surfaces/tile_hand.rb:155
msgid "The table is empty."
msgstr "Stůl je prázdný."

#: __app.rb:1099
msgid "The table is waiting for the original players. Start the game when everyone has joined."
msgstr "U stolu se čeká na původní hráče. Až se všichni připojí, spusťte hru."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:251
msgid "The table master can change another person's player or observer role from the Users list context menu. During a match, this changes only who will play in the next game."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:277
msgid "The table master can transfer ownership to another person with Ctrl+M. Leaving no longer automatically closes the whole table: another participant takes over, including control of the bots."
msgstr ""

#: games/taboo.rb:243
msgid "The table master cancels this turn's points and repeats it with new cards because of a technical problem."
msgstr "Hostitel stolu kvůli technickému problému ruší body z tohoto tahu a opakuje jej s novými kartami."

msgid "The table master chooses one to ten complete matches and may independently enable extra categories, the upper bonus, later Yahtzee bonuses and the Joker rule."
msgstr ""

msgid "The table master chooses the board and optional rules for Free Parking, salary, first-round purchases, jail rent, lucky double one, supplementary cards, automatic rent and auctions."
msgstr ""

msgid "The table master chooses the judge mode, answer language, answer time, target score and whether a tied lead causes a shared victory or another complete cycle."
msgstr ""

msgid "The table master chooses the judge mode, answer language, category pool, one to nine categories per round, answer time, target score and whether a tied lead causes a shared victory or another complete cycle."
msgstr ""

msgid "The table master chooses the question set, its language, the time for one answer and the target score. Every set is offered with the number of questions it installs, and the question language is independent of the interface language, so a Polish interface can host an Italian match."
msgstr ""

msgid "The table master chooses the question set, the question language, the answer time from five to sixty seconds and the target score, which is at least fifteen points."
msgstr ""

msgid "The table master may judge every round, or the judge may rotate in table order. A judge does not answer and receives no points in the round they judge."
msgstr ""

#: games/three_five_eight.rb:87
msgid "The table owner can disable card exchange in the game options. When it is disabled, every deal goes directly from contract selection to taking the kitty."
msgstr ""

#: games/krowa.rb:103
msgid "The table will be closed."
msgstr "Stůl bude uzavřen."

#: games/audio_ball.rb:210
msgid "The table's Sets to win setting is 1, 2 or 3; the default is 1. The first player to win the chosen number of sets wins the match. Each new set starts at 0:0, without changing the number of sets already won."
msgstr ""

msgid "The taker leads first, and the winner of each trick leads the next. A trump beats every non-trump; without a trump the highest card of the led suit wins. Collected round points and the actual score change are different figures, so both are announced."
msgstr ""

#: games/tysiac.rb:742
msgid "The talon is %{cards}."
msgstr "Talon: %{cards}."

msgid "The talon is empty"
msgstr "Talon je prázdný"

msgid "The target is 1000 by default; it may be any multiple of 5 from 200 upwards. The game always has exactly three seats, occupied by people or computers. There are no teams. The highest bidder takes the three revealed talon cards and gives one card to each opponent in the announced order. Only giver and recipient see the identity of a transferred card; other players see that a card was given."
msgstr ""

#: games/tysiac.rb:94
msgid "The target is normally 1000. You can choose another multiple of five, at least 200. Reaching the target ends the game, subject to the barrel rules below. There are no team or alternative-deck settings."
msgstr ""

#: games/spades.rb:224
msgid "The target score is a positive number, normally 300. Scores are checked after the deal. A sole leader at or above the target wins; a tie for first place means another deal. In a team game compare team scores, not individual tricks."
msgstr ""

#: games/quiz_party.rb:133
msgid "The target score must be at least %{minimum} points."
msgstr "Cílový počet bodů musí být alespoň %{minimum}."

#: games/tysiac.rb:218
msgid "The target score must be at least 200 and divisible by 5."
msgstr "Cílové skóre musí být alespoň 200 a dělitelné 5."

#: games/categories.rb:194
msgid "The target score must be between 10 and 1000 points."
msgstr "Cílové skóre musí být mezi 10 a 1000 body."

#: games/quiz_party.rb:892
msgid "The target score was reached."
msgstr "Bylo dosaženo cílového počtu bodů."

#: games/categories.rb:1014
msgid "The target score was reached. The final judge cycle has begun."
msgstr "Bylo dosaženo cílového skóre. Začal závěrečný cyklus rozhodčích."

#: games/scrabble.rb:165
msgid "The tiles have been dealt."
msgstr "Kameny byly rozdány."

#: games/scientific_war.rb:176
msgid "The trick limit must be from 20 to 100."
msgstr ""

#: games/scientific_war.rb:446
msgid "The trick limit was reached."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_surfaces/taboo_surface.rb:49
msgid "The turn clock is not running."
msgstr "Časomíra tahu neběží."

#: games/taboo.rb:38
msgid "The turn must last from 30 to 300 seconds."
msgstr "Tah musí trvat 30 až 300 sekund."

#: games/tysiac.rb:83
msgid "The two-player variant uses two separate, face-down talons. Choose two or three cards in each talon in the table settings. With two-card talons, each player is dealt ten cards. With three-card talons, each receives nine. Three cards is the default. The auction works as described above."
msgstr ""

msgid "The unjudged round was cancelled. The judge order did not advance."
msgstr "Nehodnocené kolo bylo zrušeno. Pořadí rozhodčích se neposunulo."

msgid "The upper section scores matching dice and awards 35 bonus points at 63. Straights, kinds, full house, Yahtzee and chance follow the usual rules. Full house scores the greater of 25 and the dice total."
msgstr ""

msgid "The upper-section bonus adds 35 points if the six upper rows total at least 63. It is enabled by default. You do not need three of each value separately: a strong result in Sixes can compensate for a weak result in Ones. Switching the bonus off leaves the rows themselves unchanged."
msgstr ""

#: __app.rb:2739 __app.rb:2877
msgid "The users at the table changed while teams were being selected. Please start again."
msgstr "Během výběru týmů se změnilo složení uživatelů u stolu. Začněte prosím znovu."

#: games/domino.rb:34
msgid "The whole team must finish"
msgstr "Dokončit musí celý tým"

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:206
msgid "The widget now supports 30 table presets: Ctrl+1–0, Alt+1–0 and Shift+1–0. Set them in Game Room > Settings > Widget, in the Table shortcuts list. Press a shortcut there to select its entry, then Enter to assign or edit it. Changes are saved immediately, independently of Cancel in Settings."
msgstr "Widget nyní podporuje 30 předvoleb stolu: Ctrl+1–0, Alt+1–0 a Shift+1–0. Nastavte je v Game Room > Nastavení > Widget, v seznamu Zkratky stolů. Stisknutím zkratky v tomto seznamu vyberte její položku a klávesou Enter ji přiřaďte nebo upravte. Změny se ukládají okamžitě, nezávisle na volbě Zrušit v nastavení."

msgid "The winner takes the three revealed talon cards, then gives one card to each opponent in the announced order. Each recipient learns only their own card. After these transfers, the bidder can raise the final contract within the limit allowed by the marriages still held. Playing the first card accepts the current contract, so a second bid is not compulsory."
msgstr ""

#: games/farkle.rb:53
msgid "The winning score defaults to 1000. Reaching it with unbanked points is not enough: you must bank them. Once someone banks enough, the current circuit continues through the last player in seating order. Players who have already played in that circuit do not receive another turn. The highest score then wins; equal highest scores give a draw. Older saved games may retain the earlier immediate-win rule."
msgstr ""

msgid "The winning team scores zero. Each opposing team scores its own remaining hands plus the pips still held by the winning team's partners. With The whole team must finish, everyone on the team must empty their hand; finished partners are skipped and do not draw again. A blocked round scores only each team's own hands. Check the double-blank exception separately for each hand."
msgstr ""

#: games/scrabble.rb:122
msgid "The word cannot contain an empty gap."
msgstr "Ve slově nesmí být prázdná mezera."

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:162
msgid "The word was guessed. Attempts: %{count}."
msgstr "Slovo bylo uhodnuto. Počet pokusů: %{count}."

msgid "Then, starting with the next player, each player draws a card from the public space and adds it to his or her hand. The next player then becomes the active player. The phase continues until the draw pile has been exhausted."
msgstr ""

#: games/spades.rb:223
msgid "There are also contract bonuses. With three or four players, a contract of one or two made exactly gives 20 extra points. A successful large contract adds ten per level starting at ten with three players, seven with four, six with five or five with six. For example, a four-player contract of eight earns an extra 20 for reaching levels seven and eight."
msgstr ""

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:17
msgid "There are also two ways to play with others:"
msgstr ""

msgid "There are five categories: Pigments, Monks, Forbidden Tomes, Holy Books and Manuscripts. The Scriptorium indicates how many Victory Points each category is worth. All dice start at 3, but these values may change during the game."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_surfaces/piece_board.rb:596
msgid "There are no available moves from %{field}."
msgstr "Z pole %{field} nelze provést žádný tah."

#: games/spades.rb:2622 games/three_five_eight.rb:998
msgid "There are no cards on the table."
msgstr "Na stole nejsou žádné karty."

#: games/uno.rb:445
msgid "There are no colours to choose from"
msgstr "Nejsou k dispozici žádné barvy na výběr"

msgid "There are no contacts available to invite."
msgstr "Nejsou k dispozici žádné kontakty, které by bylo možné pozvat."

