msgstr "Použít dva žolíky"

#: games/makao.rb:84
msgid "Use two jokers adds two cards that can represent an ordinary or special card. You choose what the joker represents when playing it. It only defends a penalty if the represented card would be a legal defence. Representing an ace, jack or king uses its special effect only when that effect is enabled at the table."
