#: games/rummy_ui.rb:131
msgid "You need not return every borrowed card, but each one left unplayed at the end of the turn costs 300 points. Two retained cards therefore cost 600. This is charged once; on later turns those cards are ordinary hand cards. An equivalent copy can repay one borrowed card, not several. In normal scoring, taking a card also removes its previous meld value; putting it back awards its new meld value. Moving cards around is not a source of free repeated points."
